<title>USA: Hyundai, Advanced Micro settle dispute.</title>
<headline>Hyundai, Advanced Micro settle dispute.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Group affiliate  Hyundai Electronic Industries Co Ltd and Advanced Micro Devices said Monday they settled the pending flash memory trade secret litigation brought by Advanced Micro as well as Hyundai's pending appeal.</p>
<p>In a statement, the companies said the terms of the settlement are confidential, but include injunctive relief protecting Advanced Micro's trade secrets. Advanced Micro and Hyundai disclaimed any liability for each other's claims.</p>
</text>
